WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.972
- Today we're going to be giving fans

00:00:02.972 --> 00:00:04.704
Stranger Things inspired looks

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:07.247
and I will be dressing
the characters today.

00:00:07.247 --> 00:00:09.854
So the show is set in late 70s, early 80s,

00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:11.536
midwestern America.

00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:14.696
A lot of the clothes that
they wear are so wearable,

00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:17.924
even in this day and age,
because vintage recycles itself.

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:20.756
And I think one of the most
remarkable things about

00:00:20.756 --> 00:00:22.799
the characters on the show is how they all

00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:26.211
seem to have their own
distinct, personal style.

00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:28.573
Each character really has
their individual looks that

00:00:28.573 --> 00:00:30.430
brings their personality to life.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.782
So this isn't just your
typical recreation,

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:34.239
it's not meant to be costume-y.

00:00:34.239 --> 00:00:36.028
It's supposed to be
really wearable like say

00:00:36.028 --> 00:00:39.581
if Barb is a girl you're
hanging out with in Williamsburg

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:42.369
at a dive bar what would she
be wearing in the modern day?

00:00:42.369 --> 00:00:45.299
So for Will there's that really
amazing opening scene where

00:00:45.299 --> 00:00:48.053
he's seen riding his bike
disappearing into the Upside Down,

00:00:48.053 --> 00:00:50.339
so one of the looks that
we wanted to do for him was

00:00:50.339 --> 00:00:53.388
one with the puffer two-toned jacket

00:00:53.388 --> 00:00:55.781
and then we have this plaid
flannel underneath and it

00:00:55.781 --> 00:00:58.602
also has those red tones and
the chevron on the jacket;

00:00:58.602 --> 00:01:00.309
so it's a nice color play

00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:01.679
and I think it works well together.

00:01:01.679 --> 00:01:03.515
- I'm a big fan of Stranger Things.

00:01:03.515 --> 00:01:05.572
I do feel like a slightly
older version of Will.

00:01:05.572 --> 00:01:07.651
Ya know, he liked The
Clash a lot and they were

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:10.455
pretty ritzy when it
came to their jackets,

00:01:10.455 --> 00:01:12.103
so I think it's pretty sweet.

00:01:12.103 --> 00:01:13.657
I actually related to Will a lot.

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:14.681
I was always pretty awkward.

00:01:14.681 --> 00:01:17.334
in middle school, I was
kinda a smaller, scrawny kid.

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:19.934
People tended to pick
on me from time to time

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:21.160
and I also moved around a lot,

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.742
so I was more like lost
than I think most kids were.

00:01:24.742 --> 00:01:27.518
My mom and I were kinda like
the only ones for a while.

00:01:27.518 --> 00:01:29.872
She was a single mom for
most of my childhood life,

00:01:29.872 --> 00:01:32.128
so I really related to him a lot on that.

00:01:32.128 --> 00:01:34.212
- [Apneet] Eleven is a
central character in the show.

00:01:34.212 --> 00:01:35.408
And one of her most iconic like looks

00:01:35.408 --> 00:01:38.590
is that pink dress with the blue jacket.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:41.425
It's a really important part
of the series just because

00:01:41.425 --> 00:01:44.336
that's the first time she gets
to go out and go to school

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:45.641
with the kids and interact with everyone.

00:01:45.641 --> 00:01:48.344
We gave her a corduroy jumper
paired with this really

00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:50.928
cute navy bomber and some white sneakers.

00:01:50.928 --> 00:01:53.315
And it's kinda like this
sporty, tom-boy vibe

00:01:53.315 --> 00:01:55.760
and I really think it speaks
to her character because

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:58.199
she's really tough and she's
basically up for anything.

00:01:58.199 --> 00:01:59.816
- This outfit is actually really cool.

00:01:59.816 --> 00:02:02.734
This jacket is kinda oversized
which is really nice.

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:05.637
I'm pretty sure Eleven would
totally be rocking this outfit

00:02:05.637 --> 00:02:07.970
right now if she were
walking down the streets.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.427
Eleven is one of my favorite
characters on the show.

00:02:11.427 --> 00:02:14.130
She is such a bad ass, does things without

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:17.175
even having to tap into her power;

00:02:17.175 --> 00:02:21.012
she just does it out of the
necessity of making sure

00:02:21.012 --> 00:02:22.357
her friends are okay

00:02:22.357 --> 00:02:24.065
and I think that's the
coolest thing in the world.

00:02:24.065 --> 00:02:24.898
- [Apneet] Dustin has kinda like

00:02:24.898 --> 00:02:28.359
a quirkier personal style I think

00:02:28.359 --> 00:02:29.192
than all the other characters.

00:02:29.192 --> 00:02:30.568
He's always wearing those truckers hats

00:02:30.568 --> 00:02:32.658
and his signature graphic tees.

00:02:32.658 --> 00:02:34.132
We kinda did little twist on this.

00:02:34.132 --> 00:02:36.448
Instead of his brown-colored
khakis we pair it with a skirt

00:02:36.448 --> 00:02:40.256
and kind of turned it around
so that a girl or a woman can

00:02:40.256 --> 00:02:42.979
also wear like a Dustin-inspired outfit.

00:02:42.979 --> 00:02:45.961
We wanted to put her in a denim
jacket instead of his puffy

00:02:45.961 --> 00:02:48.095
oversized coat just to
update it a little bit

00:02:48.095 --> 00:02:49.203
and keep it modern.

00:02:49.203 --> 00:02:50.629
- So I'm in the girl version of the look.

00:02:50.629 --> 00:02:51.865
I think that it's dope.

00:02:51.865 --> 00:02:55.585
Definitely something I could wear out.

00:02:55.585 --> 00:02:57.758
I'm really digging this jean jacket.

00:02:57.758 --> 00:03:00.508
I wanna keep it, I'm not kidding.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.261
Best thing about Dustin is he's
like in it for the friends.

00:03:04.261 --> 00:03:05.408
Like he's in it for the team

00:03:05.408 --> 00:03:07.922
and I think that I'm also in
it for my friends and team.

00:03:07.922 --> 00:03:11.967
So we have that kinda parallel
going where you just want to

00:03:11.967 --> 00:03:13.683
make sure that like everybody's good

00:03:13.683 --> 00:03:14.936
and like fighting for a good cause.

00:03:14.936 --> 00:03:17.143
- [Apneet] For Lucas we
chose to recreate the look

00:03:17.143 --> 00:03:18.886
where he's wearing

00:03:18.886 --> 00:03:19.836
that bandana.

00:03:19.836 --> 00:03:21.622
I feel like that's kind
of like his war paint

00:03:21.622 --> 00:03:22.824
with such an iconic look for him.

00:03:22.824 --> 00:03:25.143
He's always wearing these
great shearling jackets,

00:03:25.143 --> 00:03:27.052
so I think that's kind
of his signature look.

00:03:27.052 --> 00:03:29.922
And Lucas is gonna be wearing
skinny jeans today just

00:03:29.922 --> 00:03:32.109
to update the look a little
bit to tie it all together.

00:03:32.109 --> 00:03:35.908
- Lucas' fashion, I feel, is very smart

00:03:35.908 --> 00:03:39.948
but also outdoorsy, it's back in style.

00:03:39.948 --> 00:03:43.501
The character Lucas I
actually relate to the most.

00:03:43.501 --> 00:03:47.033
I'm the friend that always
the voice of reason,

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:49.984
but still continues to go
with the band of friends,

00:03:49.984 --> 00:03:53.147
but always in the back of my
mind I'm always questioning

00:03:53.147 --> 00:03:57.378
why are we doing this and
what's going to be the end?

00:03:57.378 --> 00:03:58.652
- [Apneet] For Barb, her
signature look is definitely

00:03:58.652 --> 00:04:01.081
the oversized spectacles

00:04:01.081 --> 00:04:03.140
paired with a plaid shirt

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.338
possibly has ruffles or
some kind of embellishment,

00:04:06.338 --> 00:04:08.590
but in kind of like a quirky way.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:12.089
We updated her look with a
floral blouse and some Levis

00:04:12.089 --> 00:04:14.737
and a little fringe bag to give
it a little bit of an edge.

00:04:14.737 --> 00:04:17.061
And I think that her overall
look is just very wearable

00:04:17.061 --> 00:04:18.907
because it's really casual;

00:04:18.907 --> 00:04:20.666
it's basically just
like jeans and a blouse

00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.501
and you can just do so much with that.

00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:24.318
- There's like the main
picture that everyone

00:04:24.318 --> 00:04:27.111
has of her where it's like very
diaper-y in the pants area.

00:04:27.111 --> 00:04:30.086
And this is like it
come down which is good

00:04:30.086 --> 00:04:31.733
cause ya know, you don't want diapers.

00:04:31.733 --> 00:04:34.041
I think I really like
Barb because she like

00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:36.313
really didn't give a fuck
which was nice 'cuz it's not,

00:04:36.313 --> 00:04:38.093
you see all of the people
following her around with

00:04:38.093 --> 00:04:40.156
peer pressure and she's kinda
like I don't want to do that

00:04:40.156 --> 00:04:42.068
and I'm just gonna do my own thing,

00:04:42.068 --> 00:04:43.935
but then she got eaten by a
monster so that's unfortunate.

00:04:43.935 --> 00:04:45.049
- I hope you guys like the looks.

00:04:45.049 --> 00:04:47.349
It was really fun creating
all of these characters

00:04:47.349 --> 00:04:49.818
and if you're inspired by this
video to go out and create

00:04:49.818 --> 00:04:52.096
your own looks, dive
into your thrift store,

00:04:52.096 --> 00:04:54.691
grab some friends, grab some lights,

00:04:54.691 --> 00:04:56.140
and just make it a party.

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.807
(relaxed music)

